# Contributing

Keep canonical skills portable and place repository-specific bindings in
overlays. With PowerShell 7.4 or later, run `./tools/Validate-Repository.ps1`, then
`Import-Module Pester -RequiredVersion 6.2.0; Invoke-Pester ./tests` before
proposing a change. Do not edit vendored runtime cores without recording
whether the change is upstream, overlay-specific, or a pending divergence.
